{"availability":"available","full":"GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker","name":"net-worth-tracker","description":"Track your net worth and investment portfolio with automatic price updates, asset allocation, expense tracking, and FIRE calculator. Modern alternative to spreadsheets. Next.js + Firebase + TypeScript.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":77,"forks":17,"created":"2025-11-09T19:15:28Z","updated":"2026-10-09T12:15:50Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://net-worth-tracker-theta.vercel.app","topics":["asset-tracking","cashflow-tracking","data-visualization","dividend-tracker","financial-independence","financial-planning","fire-calculator","firebase","investment-portfolio","italian","net-worth-tracker","nextjs","pdf-export","performance-metrics","personal-finance","portfolio-tracker","react","tailwindcss","typescript","wealth-management"],"demo":"https://net-worth-tracker-theta.vercel.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.783Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.783Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.783Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.783Z","stars":77,"forks":17}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Net Worth Tracker is a full-featured personal finance application built for Italian investors. It provides comprehensive portfolio tracking, performance analytics, cashflow management, dividend monitoring, and long-term financial planning tools — all in a single dashboard.","The app integrates with Yahoo Finance for real-time price updates and includes advanced features like Monte Carlo simulations, FIRE (Financial Independence, Retire Early) projections, AI-powered performance analysis, and a dedicated AI assistant foundation via Claude. The UI is in Italian while the codebase follows English conventions."],"features":["Overview that answers before it counts — the Panoramica opens with a one-sentence verdict on the month (\"Agosto sta andando bene.\" / \"Agosto è in calo, nonostante il mercato.\" / \"Settembre è in calo: il mercato ha…","Multi-asset tracking across stocks, ETFs, bonds, crypto, real estate, commodities, pension funds, and cash — added via a guided two-step dialog: pick the asset type first, then fill in only the relevant fields for that…","Multi-currency support: assets priced in USD, GBP, CHF, etc. are automatically converted to EUR for all portfolio calculations using live Frankfurter exchange rates; LSE pence (GBp) normalized to GBP automatically","Automatic price updates via Yahoo Finance (all assets) and Borsa Italiana (Italian bonds with ISIN)","Ticker display alias: give any investment a short, readable label (e.g. \"CL2\" instead of \"CL2.MI\") shown everywhere across the app instead of the raw ticker — automatic price updates keep using the real ticker…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"367b1fe16b9578e4d77c78eaf87e209449f5799a7803c685e70af33d455e8349","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.884Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.884Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Net Worth Tracker is a full-featured personal finance application built for Italian investors. It provides comprehensive portfolio tracking, performance analytics, cashflow management, dividend monitoring, and long-term financial planning tools — all in a single dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Net Worth Tracker is a full-featured personal finance application built for Italian investors. It provides comprehensive portfolio tracking, performance analytics, cashflow management, dividend monitoring, and long-term financial planning tools — all in a single dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Overview that answers before it counts — the Panoramica opens with a one-sentence verdict on the month (\"Agosto sta andando bene.\" / \"Agosto è in calo, nonostante il mercato.\" / \"Settembre è in calo: il mercato ha pesato, le tasse sulle vendite di più.\" / \"Settembre è in calo per le tasse sulla vendita di VWCE, non per il mercato.\" / \"Settembre è in pari: le tasse sulla…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Income and transfers cannot recur — a transfer moves two accounts at once, and each occurrence would need its own pair of balance corrections.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Transfers aren't supported (a transfer needs origin/destination accounts a historical row can't provide) and account balances are never touched by the import","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Set NEXTPUBLICDEMO env vars to enable; leave them empty and both the button and the sentence promising it disappear, on a self-hosted deploy","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Anthropic API key (optional — enables AI performance analysis)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"367b1fe16b9578e4d77c78eaf87e209449f5799a7803c685e70af33d455e8349","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.894Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T12:15:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/GiuseppeDM98/net-worth-tracker/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T16:43:27.904Z","hash":"367b1fe16b9578e4d77c78eaf87e209449f5799a7803c685e70af33d455e8349","original